.DS_Store

# Internal planning & research notes, and the pre-approval Claude Design
# deliverable. These hold Eni'ol's contact details and unreleased
# business/pricing decisions — kept local only, not on GitHub.
#
# This also matches CLAUDE.md: Claude Code reads that file straight off
# disk at the start of every session in this folder, so it doesn't need
# to be tracked in git to keep doing its job.
#
# Once the static mockup exists, everything under site/ is the actual
# deliverable and IS meant to be published/shared — nothing above
# excludes it, since these patterns are root-relative (a single leading
# slash), not recursive.
/*.md
/research/
